# fixture: disjoint_with_added_before.ttl
# Purpose: baseline for an introduced disjointness. ex:Track and ex:Person are
# two independent classes. Pairs with disjoint_with_added_after.ttl, which adds
# ex:Track owl:disjointWith ex:Person. Existing individuals may now violate the
# disjointness, so disjoint_added is breaking.

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

ex:Track a owl:Class .
ex:Person a owl:Class .
